            "In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.": [
                "Trong b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n Cloudflare c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, h\u00e3y m\u1edf R2 Object Storage v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 ch\u1ee9a (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u201cmy-pbs-library\u201d). H\u00e3y gi\u1eef n\u00f3 \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ri\u00eang t\u01b0: kh\u00f4ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i mi\u1ec1n c\u00f4ng khai."
            ],
            "Open \u201cManage API tokens\u201d in R2 and create an API token with \u201cObject Read & Write\u201d permission, limited to that one bucket.": [
                "M\u1edf ph\u1ea7n \u201cQu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u00e3 th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o API\u201d trong R2 v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o m\u00e3 th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o API c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n \u201c\u0110\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ghi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng\u201d, gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n trong m\u1ed9t nh\u00f3m l\u01b0u tr\u1eef \u0111\u00f3."
            ],
            "Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).": [
                "Sao ch\u00e9p ID kh\u00f3a truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0 Kh\u00f3a truy c\u1eadp b\u00ed m\u1eadt hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb (kh\u00f3a b\u00ed m\u1eadt ch\u1ec9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n)."
            ],
            "Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is \u201cauto\u201d.": [
                "Sao ch\u00e9p \u0111i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1i S3 cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. \u0110i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1i c\u00f3 d\u1ea1ng nh\u01b0 https:\/\/<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Khu v\u1ef1c l\u00e0 \u201cauto\u201d."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.": [
                "D\u00e1n c\u00e1c gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi, l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i, sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1ea5n \"Ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i\". Ch\u1ec9 chuy\u1ec3n th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n sang b\u1ed9 nh\u1edb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n khi ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng."
            ],
            "Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).": [
                "T\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t bucket ri\u00eang t\u01b0 v\u1edbi nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0o t\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u00edch v\u1edbi S3)."
            ],
            "Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.": [
                "T\u1ea1o kh\u00f3a truy c\u1eadp ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc, ghi v\u00e0 x\u00f3a c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong bucket \u0111\u00f3."
            ],
            "Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket\u2019s region.": [
                "T\u00ecm \u0111i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1i S3 (cho Amazon S3: %s) v\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a bucket."
            ],
            "Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off \u201cPath-style addresses\u201d. Most other services use path-style.": [
                "Amazon S3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef \u1ea3o: h\u00e3y t\u1eaft \u201cPath-style addresses\u201d. H\u1ea7u h\u1ebft c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ki\u1ec3u \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn."
            ],
            "Paste the values below, save, then press \u201cTest connection\u201d.": [
                "D\u00e1n c\u00e1c gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi, l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i, sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1ea5n \u201cKi\u1ec3m tra k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i\u201d."
            ],
            "Storage settings saved.": [
                "\u0110\u00e3 l\u01b0u c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t l\u01b0u tr\u1eef."
            ],
            "Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital\u00ae storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital\u00ae quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital\u00ae storage.": [
                "Th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00e1m m\u00e2y c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u tr\u1eef trong b\u1ed9 nh\u1edb Zinn Digital\u00ae v\u1edbi dung l\u01b0\u1ee3ng bao g\u1ed3m trong g\u00f3i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef trong b\u1ed9 ch\u1ee9a Cloudflare R2 ho\u1eb7c b\u1ed9 ch\u1ee9a t\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u00edch v\u1edbi S3 c\u1ee7a ri\u00eang b\u1ea1n: khi \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng h\u1ea1n ng\u1ea1ch Zinn Digital\u00ae, v\u00e0 m\u1ecdi trang web b\u1ea1n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 ch\u1ee9a \u0111\u1ec1u chia s\u1ebb th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n n\u00e0y. Th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n nh\u00f3m lu\u00f4n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ed9 nh\u1edb Zinn Digital\u00ae."
            ],
